Description:
  Implements 19 x slices and 45 measured Born A_parallel points for
  0.18 < Q2 < 20 GeV2, 0.1 < y < 0.91, W2 > 3.24 GeV2, and
  0.04 < theta < 0.22. The highest-energy prompt outgoing positron is used,
  excluding leptons from hadron decays. Generator scales below 1 GeV are
  frozen by the run card, so only the theory prediction there is a
  nonperturbative extrapolation; the data are measurements. The per-x Q2
  cell boundaries used by the code were not found in the audited paper,
  HEPData record, or official archive and remain unverified.
